### 4. 正式 QUAL checkpoint 恢复，GPU 6 留给 embedding

环境文件：[resume.env](/data/xyj/shengao/AgentReview_0811/AgentReview/runs/formal_qual_seed0_20260825/resume.env)

```bash
OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
OPENAI_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1
NO_PROXY=127.0.0.1,localhost
no_proxy=127.0.0.1,localhost
HF_HOME=/data/xyj/.cache/huggingface
CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=6
```

实际 tmux 启动指令：

```bash
tmux new-session -d -s formal_qual_B \
  "cd /data/xyj/shengao/AgentReview_0811/AgentReview && \
  set -a && \
  source runs/formal_qual_seed0_20260825/resume.env && \
  set +a && \
  export OPENAI_API_KEY=dummy HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1 && \
  exec bash runs/formal_qual_seed0_20260825/resume.cmd \
  >> logs/formal_qual_seed0_20260825.log 2>&1"
```

Evolution 完整参数保存在：[resume.cmd](/data/xyj/shengao/AgentReview_0811/AgentReview/runs/formal_qual_seed0_20260825/resume.cmd)

